@startuml Kafka Components Collaboration
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF

title Kafka 核心组件协作流程图

autonumber

actor "Application" as APP
box "Producer Client" #LightBlue
    participant "KafkaProducer" as PROD
    participant "RecordAccumulator" as ACC
    participant "Sender" as SENDER
    participant "Partitioner" as PART
end box

box "Broker Server" #LightGreen
    participant "SocketServer" as SS
    participant "KafkaApis" as APIS
    participant "ReplicaManager" as RM
    participant "LogManager" as LM
    participant "UnifiedLog" as LOG
    participant "GroupCoordinator" as GC
end box

box "Consumer Client" #LightYellow
    participant "KafkaConsumer" as CONS
    participant "ConsumerCoordinator" as CC
    participant "Fetcher" as FETCH
    participant "SubscriptionState" as SUB
end box

box "Stream Processing" #LightCoral
    participant "KafkaStreams" as STREAMS
    participant "StreamThread" as ST
    participant "StreamTask" as TASK
    participant "StateStore" as STATE
end box

== Producer 发送消息流程 ==

APP -> PROD : send(ProducerRecord)
note right of PROD
  **代码位置**:
  clients/src/main/java/org/apache/kafka/clients/producer/KafkaProducer.java
  - doSend() 方法
end note

PROD -> PROD : serialize(key, value)
PROD -> PART : partition(topic, key, value, cluster)
note right of PART
  **分区策略**:
  - 指定分区：直接使用
  - 有key：hash(key) % partitions
  - 无key：轮询或粘性分区
end note

PART -> PROD : partitionId
PROD -> ACC : append(topic, partition, record)
note right of ACC
  **批量累积**:
  clients/src/main/java/org/apache/kafka/clients/producer/internals/RecordAccumulator.java
  - 按分区组织批次
  - 内存池管理
  - 批次大小控制
end note

ACC -> SENDER : wakeup() [if batch full]
note right of SENDER
  **异步发送**:
  clients/src/main/java/org/apache/kafka/clients/producer/internals/Sender.java
  - 后台I/O线程
  - 批次发送优化
end note

SENDER -> SS : ProduceRequest
note right of SS
  **网络层**:
  core/src/main/scala/kafka/network/SocketServer.scala
  - Acceptor + Processor + Handler 模式
  - NIO多路复用
end note

== Broker 处理生产请求 ==

SS -> APIS : handleProduceRequest()
note right of APIS
  **API处理**:
  core/src/main/scala/kafka/server/KafkaApis.scala
  - 请求路由和验证
  - 权限检查
end note

APIS -> RM : appendRecords()
note right of RM
  **副本管理**:
  core/src/main/scala/kafka/server/ReplicaManager.scala
  - ISR管理
  - 高水位更新
  - 副本同步
end note

RM -> LM : appendAsLeader()
note right of LM
  **日志管理**:
  core/src/main/scala/kafka/log/LogManager.scala
  - 日志创建和管理
  - 清理策略
end note

LM -> LOG : append(records)
note right of LOG
  **存储引擎**:
  core/src/main/scala/kafka/log/UnifiedLog.scala
  - 日志段管理
  - 索引维护
  - 压缩和清理
end note

LOG -> LOG : updateIndex()
LOG -> RM : LogAppendInfo
RM -> APIS : ProduceResponse
APIS -> SS : sendResponse()
SS -> SENDER : ProduceResponse
SENDER -> PROD : RecordMetadata
PROD -> APP : Future<RecordMetadata>

== Consumer 消费消息流程 ==

APP -> CONS : subscribe(topics)
note right of CONS
  **消费者入口**:
  clients/src/main/java/org/apache/kafka/clients/consumer/KafkaConsumer.java
  - 委托给具体实现
end note

CONS -> SUB : subscribe(topics, listener)
note right of SUB
  **订阅状态**:
  clients/src/main/java/org/apache/kafka/clients/consumer/internals/SubscriptionState.java
  - 主题订阅管理
  - 分区分配状态
  - 偏移量跟踪
end note

CONS -> CC : poll() [if has group.id]
note right of CC
  **消费者协调**:
  clients/src/main/java/org/apache/kafka/clients/consumer/internals/ConsumerCoordinator.java
  - 组成员管理
  - 重平衡协调
  - 偏移量提交
end note

== Consumer Group 协调流程 ==

CC -> GC : JoinGroupRequest
note right of GC
  **组协调器**:
  org.apache.kafka.coordinator.group.GroupCoordinator
  - 成员管理
  - 分区分配
  - 偏移量存储
end note

GC -> CC : JoinGroupResponse(leader/follower)

alt 如果是Leader
    CC -> CC : performAssignment()
    note right of CC
      **分区分配策略**:
      - RangeAssignor: 按主题范围分配
      - RoundRobinAssignor: 轮询分配
      - StickyAssignor: 粘性分配
      - CooperativeStickyAssignor: 协作式粘性
    end note
    CC -> GC : SyncGroupRequest(assignments)
else 如果是Follower
    CC -> GC : SyncGroupRequest(empty)
end

GC -> CC : SyncGroupResponse(assignment)
CC -> SUB : assignFromSubscribed(partitions)

== Consumer 拉取数据流程 ==

APP -> CONS : poll(timeout)
CONS -> FETCH : sendFetches()
note right of FETCH
  **数据拉取**:
  clients/src/main/java/org/apache/kafka/clients/consumer/internals/Fetcher.java
  - 批量拉取优化
  - 预取机制
  - 反序列化
end note

FETCH -> SS : FetchRequest
SS -> APIS : handleFetchRequest()
APIS -> RM : fetchMessages()
RM -> LOG : read(offset, maxBytes)
LOG -> RM : FetchDataInfo
RM -> APIS : FetchResponse
APIS -> SS : sendResponse()
SS -> FETCH : FetchResponse
FETCH -> CONS : ConsumerRecords
CONS -> APP : ConsumerRecords<K,V>

== Stream 处理流程 ==

APP -> STREAMS : new KafkaStreams(topology, config)
note right of STREAMS
  **流处理主类**:
  streams/src/main/java/org/apache/kafka/streams/KafkaStreams.java
  - 拓扑管理
  - 线程协调
  - 状态管理
end note

APP -> STREAMS : start()
STREAMS -> ST : start() [for each thread]
note right of ST
  **流处理线程**:
  streams/src/main/java/org/apache/kafka/streams/processor/internals/StreamThread.java
  - 任务调度
  - 消费者管理
  - 生产者管理
end note

ST -> TASK : process()
note right of TASK
  **流处理任务**:
  streams/src/main/java/org/apache/kafka/streams/processor/internals/StreamTask.java
  - 处理器链执行
  - 状态存储访问
  - 输出记录生成
end note

TASK -> STATE : get/put(key, value)
note right of STATE
  **状态存储**:
  streams/src/main/java/org/apache/kafka/streams/state/
  - RocksDB持久化存储
  - 内存存储
  - 变更日志备份
end note

TASK -> PROD : send(outputRecord) [内部Producer]
PROD -> SS : ProduceRequest [输出到下游主题]

== 关键协作模式 ==

note over APP, STATE
  **1. 生产者模式**:
  - 批量累积 + 异步发送
  - 分区策略 + 负载均衡
  - 幂等性 + 事务支持
  
  **2. 消费者模式**:
  - 组协调 + 自动重平衡
  - 偏移量管理 + 容错恢复
  - 拉取模式 + 背压控制
  
  **3. 存储模式**:
  - 分区日志 + 副本机制
  - 顺序写入 + 索引优化
  - 压缩清理 + 分层存储
  
  **4. 流处理模式**:
  - 拓扑构建 + 任务分配
  - 状态管理 + 容错恢复
  - 时间语义 + 窗口操作
end note

@enduml
